 "rule": "One register and one decision function (core/interfaces.py, ts/src/interfaces.ts, shared vectors) choose the interface version for every device. No screen decides its own layout. Order: Change view (the person's own override, remembered per device; on selling devices only the owner may set it), the registered device record (confirmed by LynkDriver from the attached hardware), what the device reports about itself (never the browser's name), then the safe default that works with every input. Devices with touch and a pointer or keyboard follow the input used last. A change never happens in the middle of a payment, count or signature. Type and spacing per class come from design/tokens.v1.json fonts.device_classes.",
